    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Shape of The Wind",
        "jpn": null
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "The wanderer of the world, Lancelot, the clever Xiao Cao, the beautiful girl Zi Yu, the cat girl Feng'er, and the manipulator Zhou Gong Jin gather in Hangzhou to play the first chapter of the legend of the Windy Land. Welcome to the world of Windy Tales.(DeepL)",
        "jpn": null
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Fengzi Wuyu",
        "Continent of The  Wind",
        "The Story of Fengzhi Senla"
    ],
    "Modified": "2023-01-19",
    "Seasons": {
        "1": {
            "ID": "2023653",
            "URL": "https://thetvdb.com/series/425708-/seasons/official/1",
            "Titles": {
                "eng": "Yinhe Pian - Galaxy Arc",
                "jpn": null,
                "zho": "银河篇"
            },
            "Summaries": {
                "eng": "The story of Lan Si Luo, a young boy from the mountains, who met and befriended Princess Liya, a woman dressed as a man, in Hangzhou city, and later met and fell in love with Zi Yu, the young princess of the Dragon Clan. Afterward, Lan Si Luo obtained the Heavenly Demon Scripture during a treasure hunt at the Thunder Peak Pagoda, and opened it under the guidance of Li Ya, and from then on, his destiny changed, and he embarked on a journey to fight for supremacy in the Windy Continent.(DeepL)",
                "jpn": null,
                "zho": "银河篇主要讲述山野小子兰斯洛，在杭州城偶遇女扮男装的稷下公主莉雅并结拜成兄弟，期间兰斯洛邂逅龙族少主紫钰并产生了一段爱情。此后兰斯洛在雷峰塔寻宝中得到天魔经，并在莉雅的引导下开启天魔经，从此命运轮转，踏上风姿大陆的争霸的旅程的故事。"
            },
